# EES stack

```
frontend/     Next.js App Router, TypeScript
backend/      Hono, TypeScript, Postgres
mcp-bridge/   Python FastAPI bridge to Google Workspace MCP
docker-compose.yml
```

- `docker compose up --build` is the run path. App URL is http://localhost:3000. API URL is http://localhost:4000. Bridge URL is http://localhost:8100.
- The backend owns all case writes. The frontend calls the API only. The browser never calls MCP servers.
- Backend holds `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` and talks to `mcp-bridge`. Google OAuth stays in `~/.config/google-workspace-mcp/` — do not put Google, Slack, or other tokens in the app image, source, or compose file.
- Copy `.env.example` to `.env`. Never commit `.env`.
